flowchart TD
    X[Observed token prefix] --> A{Select candidate causal core}
    A --> D0[D0: strong dense reference]
    A --> H1[H1: published hybrid]
    A --> R1[R1: recurrent depth]
    A --> A1[A1: adaptive predictive state hypothesis]
    A --> X0[X0: new independent principle]
    D0 --> Z[Native latent state]
    H1 --> Z
    R1 --> Z
    A1 --> Z
    X0 --> Z
    Z --> K{Another bounded causal step?}
    K -->|Evidence supported| T[State transition]
    T --> Z
    K -->|Stop| Y[Native next token distribution]
    W[Resettable scoped working state] <--> Z
    L[Optional bitemporal exact store] -.->|Augmented system only| W
    Y --> E[Independent held out evaluation]
    E --> LED[Evidence and decision ledger]
    LED --> V[Reject, revise or promote]
